SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Ioannis Theologos\, Nikia
LOCATION:Nikia\, Nisyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The monastery of Agios Ioannis Theologos just below Nikia\, the village on the crater rim\, has its feast on 25-26 September: vespers\, food in the courtyard and dancing to violin and laouto. Late season\, so a good excuse to see the volcano with few people around.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/nisyros/#nikia-panigiri-of-agios-ioannis-theologos-nikia
